editor_description = "Story beat 12, depth 15,200, after the credits: the lantern-staff man tells the player the end has been reached and only miles of stone remain between them and the Thief. His third and last appearance, and the slowest: he enters from further out and leaves without hurry, because nothing follows him. His art is drawn looking left, so he stays on the miner's right."
